    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 49.271,
      "end": 53.361,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这一次是我们泽木镇举办的第三届",
      "score": 0.3801,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5757,
        "sc_logprob": -0.6917,
        "sc_delta": -0.1161,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.555,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这一次已经是我们周木镇举办的第三届。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 53.544,
      "end": 57.093,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个“泽里问道”的一个稻田音乐会了。",
      "score": 0.1974,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1247,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1589,
        "sc_delta": -0.0342,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.07,
        "seg_cer": 0.133,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "泽/这",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个这里问到的一个稻田音乐会了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 57.145,
      "end": 61.193,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那么这个音乐会的举办呢，我们的目的是有两个：",
      "score": 0.0003,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0601,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0445,
        "sc_delta": 0.0156,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.001,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么，这个音乐会的举办呢？我们的目的是有两个。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 61.346,
      "end": 66.446,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "首先呢是让我们的市民知道我们体验我们的农耕文化，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0193,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0201,
        "sc_delta": -0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "首先呢，是让我们的市民知道我们体验我们的农耕文化。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 66.594,
      "end": 73.307,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "同时呢也让我们的老百姓、让我们的小孩子知道我们的粮食来之不易。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0589,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0561,
        "sc_delta": 0.0028,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "同时呢，也让我们的，老百姓，让我们的小孩子，知道我们的粮食来之不易。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 73.495,
      "end": 79.945,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "呃，同时可以对我们泽木镇的呃这个旅游经济进行有一定的推动作用，",
      "score": 0.1306,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0416,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0441,
        "sc_delta": -0.0024,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.103,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "镇/正",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "呃，同时可以对我们正不正的呃，这个旅游经济进行有一定的推动作用。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 79.945,
      "end": 84.217,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "然后实现乡村振兴，让我们的老百姓在家门口吃上",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "然后实现乡村振兴，让我们的老百姓在家门口吃上。"
